---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import Callout from '../components/Callout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';

/** Section anchors, in page order. Other pages link to these ids. */
const toc = [
	{ id: 'acceptance', label: 'Acceptance of Terms' },
	{ id: 'account-registration', label: 'Account Registration' },
	{ id: 'use-of-the-service', label: 'Use of the Service' },
	{ id: 'family-accounts', label: 'Family Accounts' },
	{ id: 'subscriptions-and-payments', label: 'Subscriptions and Payments' },
	{ id: 'user-content', label: 'User Content' },
	{ id: 'data-retention', label: 'Data Retention' },
	{ id: 'intellectual-property', label: 'Intellectual Property' },
	{ id: 'third-party-services', label: 'Third-Party Services' },
	{ id: 'disclaimer-of-warranties', label: 'Disclaimer of Warranties' },
	{ id: 'limitation-of-liability', label: 'Limitation of Liability' },
	{ id: 'account-termination', label: 'Account Termination' },
	{ id: 'changes', label: 'Changes to These Terms' },
	{ id: 'governing-law', label: 'Governing Law' },
	{ id: 'contact', label: 'Contact Us' },
];
---

<LegalLayout
	title="Terms of Service — Daisy's Dailies"
	description="The terms that govern your use of the Daisy's Dailies mobile app."
	heading="Terms of Service"
	toc={toc}
>
	<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
	<p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> March 21, 2026</p>
	<p><strong>Last Updated:</strong> November 13, 2026</p>

	<p>
		Welcome to Daisy's Dailies. These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the
		Daisy's Dailies mobile application ("App") operated by Sibert Strategy Group ("we,"
		"us," or "our"). By creating an account or using the App, you agree to be bound by
		these Terms.
	</p>

	<h2 id="acceptance">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>

	<p>
		By accessing or using Daisy's Dailies, you agree to these Terms and our
		<a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. If you do not agree to these Terms, you
		may not use the App.
	</p>

	<h2 id="account-registration">2. Account Registration</h2>

	<ul>
		<li>You must provide accurate and complete information when creating an account.</li>
		<li>You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your login credentials.</li>
		<li>You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account.</li>
		<li>
			You must be at least 13 years of age to create an account, or at least 16 if you are
			located in the European Union. See the Children's Privacy section of our
			<a href="/privacy-policy#childrens-privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
		</li>
		<li>You may not create an account on behalf of someone else without their permission.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 id="use-of-the-service">3. Use of the Service</h2>

	<h3>A. Permitted Use</h3>
	<p>
		Daisy's Dailies is a personal productivity tool for organizing daily tasks, errands,
		and appointments. You may use the App for its intended purpose in accordance with
		these Terms.
	</p>

	<h3>B. Prohibited Conduct</h3>
	<p>You agree not to:</p>
	<ul>
		<li>Use the App for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable laws</li>
		<li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the App or its systems</li>
		<li>Interfere with or disrupt the App's functionality or servers</li>
		<li>Reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble the App</li>
		<li>Use the App to transmit harmful, offensive, or inappropriate content</li>
		<li>Create multiple accounts to circumvent subscription limits</li>
		<li>Share your account credentials with others</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 id="family-accounts">4. Family Accounts</h2>

	<Callout tone="info">
		<p><strong>Family Owner:</strong> The user who creates a family is the owner and is responsible for managing family membership.</p>
		<p><strong>Family Members:</strong> Members invited to a family share access to the family's flowers, petals, and items. The family owner controls membership.</p>
		<p><strong>Shared Data:</strong> Content created within a family is visible to all family members. You are responsible for the content you create within shared family spaces.</p>
	</Callout>

	<h2 id="subscriptions-and-payments">5. Subscriptions and Payments</h2>

	<h3>A. Free and Pro Tiers</h3>
	<p>
		Daisy's Dailies offers a free tier and a paid Pro tier. The free tier includes planning
		with flowers and petals, family sharing, appointments, notifications, and route planning,
		each within limits: for example, on the number of flowers, petals per flower, family
		members, repeating petals and appointments, and stops in a route. The Pro tier raises
		those limits and adds further features, such as the full Family Week view, Plan My Week,
		calendar import and sync, and real-time travel times. Some limits also apply on the Pro
		tier.
	</p>
	<p>
		The AI features (AI route optimization, Quick Add, and Plan My Week) have usage
		allowances. Free accounts receive a limited number of AI requests, which does not renew.
		The Pro tier includes a monthly allowance.
	</p>
	<p>
		The current features and limits of each tier are shown in the App and on our
		<a href="/#pricing">pricing page</a>. Feature availability and limits may change over time.
	</p>

	<h3>B. Billing</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>
			The Pro tier is sold as a monthly or yearly subscription, or as a one-time Lifetime
			purchase, through the Apple App Store or Google Play Store.
		</li>
		<li>Payment is charged to your App Store or Play Store account at confirmation of purchase.</li>
		<li>Subscriptions automatically renew unless canceled at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing period.</li>
		<li>You can manage and cancel your subscription in your device's settings.</li>
		<li>
			A Lifetime purchase is a single payment that does not renew. It gives you lifetime access
			to Pro.
		</li>
		<li>Prices are shown in the App and in the stores before you buy, and may vary by country.</li>
	</ul>

	<h3>C. Free Trials</h3>
	<p>
		Each new family receives a 14-day trial of the Pro tier. The trial does not require a
		payment method and does not convert to a paid subscription. When it ends, your family
		returns to the free tier unless you choose to buy Pro. Nothing you created during the
		trial is deleted, but the free tier's features and limits apply again; for example,
		repeating petals and appointments above the free limit are paused. Each family receives
		the trial once.
	</p>
	<p>
		We may change or end trial offers for new families at any time. If a subscription you buy
		through the App Store or Google Play includes its own introductory offer, the terms shown
		at purchase apply, including any automatic renewal.
	</p>

	<h3>D. Refunds</h3>
	<p>
		Refund requests are handled by Apple or Google according to their respective refund
		policies. We do not process refunds directly.
	</p>

	<h2 id="user-content">6. User Content</h2>

	<ul>
		<li>You retain ownership of the content you create in the App (flowers, petals, items, appointments, etc.).</li>
		<li>You grant us a limited license to store, process, and display your content solely to provide the service to you.</li>
		<li>We do not claim ownership of your content and do not use it for advertising or marketing purposes.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 id="data-retention">7. Data Retention</h2>

	<Callout tone="important">
		<p><strong>Automatic Data Cleanup:</strong> Certain data types are automatically deleted to keep your account organized:</p>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>Appointments:</strong> Appointments are automatically deleted 30 days after their scheduled date (available to all tiers).</li>
		</ul>
		<p>For full details on data retention and deletion, please see our <a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion Instructions</a>.</p>
	</Callout>

	<h2 id="intellectual-property">8. Intellectual Property</h2>

	<p>
		The App, including its design, code, graphics, and branding, is owned by Sibert Strategy
		Group and protected by intellectual property laws. You may not copy, modify, distribute,
		or create derivative works based on the App.
	</p>

	<h2 id="third-party-services">9. Third-Party Services</h2>

	<p>
		The App integrates with third-party services including Google Maps, Firebase, RevenueCat,
		Google Gemini (the AI features: route optimization, Quick Add, and Plan My Week),
		Aptabase (anonymous usage analytics), and Expo (push notifications).
		Your use of these services is subject to their respective terms of service and privacy
		policies. We are not responsible for the practices of third-party services.
	</p>

	<h2 id="disclaimer-of-warranties">10. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>

	<Callout tone="info">
		<p>
			The App is provided "as is" and "as available" without warranties of any kind, whether
			express or implied. We do not guarantee that the App will be uninterrupted, error-free,
			or secure. We are not responsible for any loss of data or interruption of service.
		</p>
	</Callout>

	<h2 id="limitation-of-liability">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>

	<p>
		To the maximum extent permitted by law, Sibert Strategy Group shall not be liable for any
		indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of
		or inability to use the App, including but not limited to loss of data, loss of profits,
		or business interruption.
	</p>

	<h2 id="account-termination">12. Account Termination</h2>

	<ul>
		<li>You may delete your account at any time through the Settings screen in the App.</li>
		<li>We may suspend or terminate your account if you violate these Terms.</li>
		<li>
			Upon termination, your data will be handled in accordance with our
			<a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and
			<a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion Instructions</a>.
		</li>
	</ul>

	<h2 id="changes">13. Changes to These Terms</h2>

	<p>
		We may update these Terms from time to time. When we make changes, we will update the
		"Last Updated" date at the top of these Terms. Continued use of the App after changes
		constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms. We encourage you to review these Terms
		periodically.
	</p>

	<h2 id="governing-law">14. Governing Law</h2>

	<p>
		These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the United
		States, without regard to conflict of law principles.
	</p>

	<h2 id="contact">15. Contact Us</h2>

	<Callout tone="important">
		<p>If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:</p>
		<p>
			<strong>Sibert Strategy Group</strong><br />
			Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
		</p>
	</Callout>

	<hr />

	<p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
		See also our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> and
		<a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion Instructions</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
